      "comment": "PAW QUEBEC (1) was an upset winner last time when scoring at big odds in a Grade 5 at The Meadows (30.41). Form here sound including three wins. Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. ASCEND IGLOO (7) used the inside draw to advantage last time and hit the ground running with a fast early split, but could manage only the minor money when a 5.5 lengths third at Healesville over 350m in 19.69. Can measure up. CALLAHAN (4) lines up chasing another win after getting around the 390m at this track in a decent 22.15 on October 5. Expecting another bold showing. MISCLASSIFIED (3) missed the frame latest (24.31) when sixth over 425m at Bendigo in a Grade 5. Has already won two times from this draw.",
